    "new_hires": {
      "type": "section",
      "name": "New hires and reorders",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "content_direction": "column",
        "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column": "flex-start",
        "gap": 12,
        "padding-block-start": 48,
        "padding-block-end": 48,
        "background_color": "#e6ece6"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "record": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"at-checklist\"><div class=\"at-checklist__intro\"><p class=\"at-checklist__eyebrow\">04 / New hires &amp; reorders</p><h2 id=\"new-hires\" class=\"at-checklist__title at-guide-target\" tabindex=\"-1\">Add new hires in the same colors</h2></div><p class=\"at-checklist__note\"><strong>Colors match within the same style.</strong> A color with the same name in a different style or brand may not match exactly, so check a sample before mixing styles.</p><p class=\"at-checklist__note\">Write down your crew&rsquo;s standard: the styles, colors and fits you chose, plus a backup. Then every new hire and replacement order matches what&rsquo;s already in use. Here&rsquo;s an example record.</p><ol class=\"at-checklist__items\"><li><strong>Core styles</strong><p>Tee: <a href=\"/products/port-company-pc55-core-blend-tee\">PC55</a>, with <a href=\"/products/port-company-pc55t-tall-core-blend-tee\">PC55T tall</a> and <a href=\"/products/port-company-lpc55-women-s-core-blend-tee\">LPC55 women&rsquo;s</a>. Polo: <a href=\"/products/port-authority-k500-silk-touch-polo\">K500</a>, with <a href=\"/products/port-authority-l500-women-s-silk-touch-polo\">L500 women&rsquo;s</a> and <a href=\"/products/port-authority-tlk500-tall-silk-touch-polo\">TLK500 tall</a>.</p></li><li><strong>Seasonal layer</strong><p><a href=\"/products/port-company-pc78q-core-fleece-1-4-zip-pullover-sweatshirt\">PC78Q</a>, or <a href=\"/products/sport-tek-st357-posicharge-competitor-1-4-zip-pullover\">ST357</a> with <a href=\"/products/sport-tek-lst357-women-s-posicharge-competitor-1-4-zip-pullover\">LST357</a> when you need a women&rsquo;s fit.</p></li><li><strong>Palette and fits</strong><p>One color listed in every chosen style, such as Navy (Sport-Tek lists True Navy). Note the adult, women&rsquo;s and tall size range for each style.</p></li><li><strong>Decoration and backup</strong><p>Record placement and method, such as left-chest embroidery on polos and screen print on tees. Name a same-role backup: <a href=\"/products/port-company-pc54-core-cotton-tee\">PC54</a> for PC55, <a href=\"/products/core365-88181-men-s-origin-performance-piqu-polo\">88181</a> for K500.</p></li></ol><p class=\"at-checklist__note\"><strong>When you reorder:</strong> order new-hire sizes from the same style and color, keep a few common sizes for replacements, add a seasonal layer in a color your styles share, and name a backup style in case a color or size runs short. Choose your styles in <a href=\"#everyday-crew\">Outfit your everyday crew</a> and <a href=\"#customer-facing\">Dress your customer-facing team</a>.</p></div>"
          }
        }
      },
